/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>uint32_t<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">src_clk_freq<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">CLK_SRC_ADC frequency wanted. The frequency will automatically be adjusted to be within valid range according to reference manual.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p style=\"color:inherit\">Initializes common parts for both single conversion and scan sequence. In addition, single and/or scan control configuration must be done, please refer to <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/iadc#sl-hal-iadc-init-single\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_init_single()<\/a> and <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/iadc#sl-hal-iadc-init-scan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_init_scan()<\/a> respectively.<\/p><p style=\"color:inherit\"><strong>Note<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"list-style:\"><li><p style=\"color:inherit\">This function will stop any ongoing conversions. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><br><\/div><div><h3>sl_hal_iadc_calculate_gain_offset<span id=\"sl-hal-iadc-calculate-gain-offset\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#sl-hal-iadc-calculate-gain-offset\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>void sl_hal_iadc_calculate_gain_offset (IADC_TypeDef * iadc, const <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/sl-hal-iadc-init-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_init_t<\/a> * init, <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/iadc#sl-hal-iadc-config-adc-mode-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_config_adc_mode_t<\/a> adc_mode, uint8_t config, uint32_t adc_clk_prescale)<\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Calculate gain and offset. <\/p><div class=\"parameters-section\"><strong class=\"parameters\">Parameters<\/strong><table><thead><tr><th>Type<\/th><th>Direction<\/th><th>Argument Name<\/th><th>Description<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>IADC_TypeDef *<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">iadc<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">Pointer to IADC peripheral register block.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>const <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/sl-hal-iadc-init-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_init_t<\/a> *<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">init<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">Pointer to IADC initialization structure.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/iadc#sl-hal-iadc-config-adc-mode-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_config_adc_mode_t<\/a><\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">adc_mode<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">Mode for IADC config.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>uint8_t<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">config<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">IADC config number.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>uint32_t<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">adc_clk_prescale<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">IADC clock prescaler. <\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p style=\"color:inherit\">This function calculates the gain and offset values for the IADC based on the provided configuration.<\/p><br><\/div><div><h3>sl_hal_iadc_reset<span id=\"sl-hal-iadc-reset\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#sl-hal-iadc-reset\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>void sl_hal_iadc_reset (IADC_TypeDef * iadc)<\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Reset IADC to same state as after a HW reset. <\/p><div class=\"parameters-section\"><strong class=\"parameters\">Parameters<\/strong><table><thead><tr><th>Type<\/th><th>Direction<\/th><th>Argument Name<\/th><th>Description<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>IADC_TypeDef *<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">iadc<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">Pointer to IADC peripheral register block. <\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><br><\/div><div><h3>sl_hal_iadc_init_scan<span id=\"sl-hal-iadc-init-scan\" class=\"self-anchor\"><a class=\"perm\" href=\"#sl-hal-iadc-init-scan\">#<\/a><\/span><\/h3><blockquote>void sl_hal_iadc_init_scan (IADC_TypeDef * iadc, const <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/sl-hal-iadc-init-scan-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_init_scan_t<\/a> * init, const <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/sl-hal-iadc-scan-table-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_scan_table_t<\/a> * scan_table)<\/blockquote><p style=\"color:inherit\">Initialize IADC scan sequence. <\/p><div class=\"parameters-section\"><strong class=\"parameters\">Parameters<\/strong><table><thead><tr><th>Type<\/th><th>Direction<\/th><th>Argument Name<\/th><th>Description<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>IADC_TypeDef *<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">iadc<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">Pointer to IADC peripheral register block.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>const <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/sl-hal-iadc-init-scan-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_init_scan_t<\/a> *<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">init<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">Pointer to IADC initialization structure.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>const <a href=\"http://docs.silabs.com/gecko-platform/5.2.2/platform-peripheral-efr32xg24/sl-hal-iadc-scan-table-t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\">sl_hal_iadc_scan_table_t<\/a> *<\/td><td>[in]<\/td><td class=\"paramname\">scan_table<\/td><td><p style=\"color:inherit\">Pointer to IADC scan table structure.<\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p style=\"color:inherit\">This function will configure scan mode and set up entries in the scan table. The scan table mask can be updated by calling IADC_updateScanMask.<\/p><p style=\"color:inherit\"><strong>Note<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"list-style:\"><li><p style=\"color:inherit\">This function will stop any ongoing conversions. If an even numbered pin is selecte